  "question_stem": "It is given that $$\\int_{1}^{a} x^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\ln x \\, \\mathrm{d}x = 2,$$ where $a > 1$.",
  "context_texts": [
    "$$a^{3/2} = \\dfrac{7 + 2a^{3/2}}{3\\ln a}$$",
    "For $F(x) = 3x^{3/2}\\ln x - 2x^{3/2} - 7$, $F(2) \\approx -6.78$ and $F(4) \\approx 10.3$, so $2 < a < 4$."
  ],
